<title>ESTONIA: SOCCER-ESTONIA AND BELARUS DRAW 1-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ESTONIA AND BELARUS DRAW 1-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia and Belarus drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in their European under-21 group four qualifier</p>
<p>on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Estonia - Konstantin Kolbasenko (40th)</p>
<p>Belarus - Vladimir Ostrikov (38th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 300</p>
